1000-00004</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kinnear</surname><given-names>WJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Kinnear</surname><given-names>GC</given-names></name><name><surname>Watson</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Webb</surname><given-names>JK</given-names></name><name><surname>Johnston</surname><given-names>ID</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Pulmonary function after spinal surgery for idiopathic scoliosis</article-title><source>Spine</source><year>1992</year><volume>17</volume><fpage>708</fpage><lpage>713</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1626305</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1097/00007632-199206000-00011</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>